sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Flutter (Coach/Adjoint)
    participant API as API Express :4000
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant LINEUP as Lineup Service :8100

    App->>API: POST /api/v1/matches/:id/ai-recommendations
    API->>API: authMiddleware (JWT, role COACH/ADJOINT)
    API->>DB: match + appartenance equipe verifies
    alt match introuvable ou acces refuse
        API-->>App: 404 / 403 ApiError
    else match valide
        API->>DB: getLineUpFeatures (presence 10 seances, perf 5 matchs, cwr proxy 7j/28j, daysSinceLastMatch)
        API->>LINEUP: POST /api/v1/lineup/recommendations {matchId, players}
        alt lineup injoignable (AbortController 5s)
            LINEUP-->>API: timeout / connexion refusee
            API-->>App: 503 ServiceUnavailable
        else lineup repond
            LINEUP-->>API: 200 {weightsVersion, recommendations[finalScore 0-100]}
            Note over API: zod valide la reponse
            alt reponse invalide
                API-->>App: 502 BadGateway
            else reponse valide
                API->>DB: storeLineUpRecommendations (scores /100 normalises 0-1)
                API-->>App: 200 {normalizedScores, weightsVersion, status}
            end
        end
    end